# api-exam-purchase

Add `EXAM_MODULE` to the existing `payments` payable type. Verify it in the existing payment verify route. `payable_id` is the exam-module purchase id.

Access is lifetime. Do not add `expires_at`, an expiry job, a cancel route, or a refund status.

`OPEN` and `ENROLLED_ONLY` return `EXAM_NOT_FOR_SALE`. A successful verify grants access only while the module is still published and `PURCHASE_REQUIRED`.

`price_paid` stays at the amount copied when the student submitted the transaction reference.
